sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist<br/>(Notebook / Workbench)
    participant SDK as CodeFlare SDK<br/>(Python Client)
    participant AuthKit as kube-authkit<br/>Auth Auto-Detection
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP TLS
    participant KubeRay as KubeRay Operator
    participant Kueue as Kueue Controller
    participant RayCluster as Ray Cluster Pods
    participant RayDash as Ray Dashboard<br/>HTTP/HTTPS

    Note over User,RayDash: Flow 1: CRD-Based Job Submission (KubeRay Path)

    User->>SDK: Submit RayJob<br/>(entrypoint, runtime_env, queue)
    SDK->>AuthKit: config_check()<br/>Auto-detect credentials
    AuthKit-->>SDK: K8s client configured<br/>(Bearer / kubeconfig / in-cluster SA)
    SDK->>SDK: Generate TLS certs<br/>(RSA 3072-bit, x509)
    SDK->>K8sAPI: Create Secret<br/>(TLS certificates)
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: Secret created
    SDK->>K8sAPI: Create RayJob CR<br/>(via vendored RayjobApi)<br/>+ Kueue annotations
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: RayJob CR created
    K8sAPI->>Kueue: Workload admission<br/>(local queue + priority class)
    Kueue-->>K8sAPI: Workload admitted
    K8sAPI->>KubeRay: Reconcile RayJob CR
    KubeRay->>K8sAPI: Create Ray cluster pods
    K8sAPI-->>KubeRay: Pods scheduled
    KubeRay->>RayCluster: Start Ray head + workers
    RayCluster-->>KubeRay: Job completed
    KubeRay->>K8sAPI: Update RayJob status
    SDK->>K8sAPI: Poll RayJob status
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: Job status + results

    Note over User,RayDash: Flow 2: Direct Job Submission (Ray Dashboard Path)

    User->>SDK: Submit via RayJobClient<br/>(dashboard_address, headers)
    SDK->>RayDash: POST job submission<br/>HTTP headers + cookies<br/>TLS verification enabled
    RayDash-->>SDK: Job ID
    SDK->>RayDash: GET job status<br/>(poll)
    RayDash-->>SDK: Job result

    Note over User,RayDash: Flow 3: Certificate Generation

    User->>SDK: generate_cert()
    SDK->>SDK: Generate CA cert<br/>(RSA 3072-bit, x509)
    SDK->>SDK: Generate server cert<br/>(signed by CA)
    SDK->>K8sAPI: Create TLS Secret<br/>(ca.crt, tls.crt, tls.key)
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: Secret stored
